Background:
The item for consideration is a Final Plat. This is approved by Resolution.

The proposed Governing Body review schedule is as follows:
•
Introduction and Referral 10/23/2023
•
Public Services Committee 11/7/2023
•
Final consideration 11/13/2023

Planning Commission Recommendation:
The Planning Commission heard this item at their October 16, 2023 meeting and unanimously voted to
recommend the Governing Body to approve this application, with staff’s recommended exception and
condition.

The Planning Commission Staff Report is attached and remains unchanged.

